{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 2, "text": "I have completed the source-fidelity preflight review as requested. The process involved a full read of the inventor sources (`input/disclosure.md`, `input/conversation.md`), the drafting brief (`input/brief.md`), and all draft application files, including claims, description, abstract, numerals, and all figure briefs. Every claim limitation in `draft/09-claims.md`, every numbered part in `draft/numerals.md`, and every structure described in `draft/08-detailed-description.md` and the `figures/*.md` briefs was traced to an affirmative statement in the inventor source files.\n\nThe review identified one minor internal inconsistency. The detailed description of FIG. 2 fails to mention the coupling of the controller to the connector current sensor, a connection that is explicitly described in the corresponding figure brief for FIG. 2. This omission makes the text an incomplete description of the figure. All other aspects of the draft, including the claims, are fully supported by the inventor's disclosure and are internally consistent."}
